      <div class="container "><div class="content-box content-box--large content-box--text-left content-box--left text-container"><h3 class="heading h2">What&#39;s in the box (and why this brand)</h3><p>The <strong>Naväge Advanced Nose Cleaner </strong>includes everything you need to start tonight:</p><ul><li>The <strong>Naväge Nose Cleaner</strong> — the powered device that does the work for you</li><li><strong>20 SaltPods</strong> — pre-measured, 99.9% pure sea salt capsules that mix a perfectly balanced, drug-free rinse every time (no guessing, no mess, no "too much salt" sting)</li><li><strong>Premium Air-Dry Mat</strong></li></ul><p></p><p>A few things worth knowing: Naväge is the <strong>#1 brand in powered nasal suction.</strong> It's <strong>drug-free</strong> and <strong>cleared by the U.S. FDA</strong> for use by adults and children 12 and older. The pre-measured SaltPods exist for a reason — too much or too little salt is what makes a homemade rinse burn. These take that variable off the table entirely.</p><p><em>One honest note, because I believe in being straight with you:</em> always use distilled, sterile bottled, micro-filtered, or previously boiled-and-cooled water — never untreated tap water. And clean the device after each use. It takes a minute and it matters.</p></div>
